{"about_the_game":"<strong>Rex: Another Island</strong> is a platforming adventure inspired by the classics.<br><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open world platforming action, contained in a single huge level.<br></li><li>Many unique areas, each with their own motif, challenges and music.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/e9daca7451b7ae328b645b7459f2517d.poster.avif?t=1588696034\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/e9daca7451b7ae328b645b7459f2517d.webm?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/e9daca7451b7ae328b645b7459f2517d.mp4?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>The Forest, one of many areas in the game</i><br><br></li><li>Zoom between shrines and fast-travel to new areas if you get stuck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/aa41b0d5cc59523fe575b9573afccdd1.avif?t=1588696034\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><i>A shrine and a rare gem</i><br><br></li><li>A checkpoint system that you can use to make the game easy or difficult... take your time and explore or zoom past everything to top the speedrun leaderboards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/193fbb52d281f458f11cb84730c17cee.poster.avif?t=1588696034\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/193fbb52d281f458f11cb84730c17cee.webm?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/193fbb52d281f458f11cb84730c17cee.mp4?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Checkpoints save your progress but slow you down</i><br><br></li><li>777 coins to find... collect them all for a secret ending.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/bb9aa72e8674188c1483073a8da4341b.poster.avif?t=1588696034\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/bb9aa72e8674188c1483073a8da4341b.webm?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/bb9aa72e8674188c1483073a8da4341b.mp4?t=1588696034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Put your platforming skills to the test, for fun and profit</i><br><br></li><li>5 hidden gems to find for a another secret ending!<br></li><li>Full soundtrack by Pete Gresser (Reimagine: The Game)</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699150/extras/1a47361e2a0eb48e2cef892ca1cd4336.webp?t=1588696034\" width=616 height=60 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"0e9703ef3fa52020de171fb219ba69e3278076a7.jpg","localized_name":"Normal Ending Found","name":"Normal Ending Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/699150/0e9703ef3fa52020de171fb219ba69e3278076a7.jpg"},{"icon":"611f3af6b08dd93a02e2b44908f2b9e54674cf7e.jpg","localized_name":" Magic Gem Ending","name":" Magic Gem Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/699150/611f3af6b08dd93a02e2b44908f2b9e54674cf7e.jpg"},{"icon":"6a766d778d5c5b617952b2b7b5ef5978f535fba0.jpg","localized_name":"Secret 777 Ending","name":"Secret 777 Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam